  "status": "hand",
  "note": "Block group pages: every block is one variant shown on /blocks/<category>/<section> (e.g. app-shell-1..5 on /blocks/application/app-shells, storefront-hero-* on /blocks/e-commerce/storefront-hero); the rewrite maps each name to its category/section path taken from the registry's own meta fields, so a click lands on the page that shows the variant (page anchors #<name> exist but are not used). 269 blocks fill; the 5 motion-* ui items have no page (no /blocks/motion/motion) and stay url-less."
}